          <li><strong>Fake reviews.</strong> A review you wrote, bought, or posted in a customer's name is not proof. We do not write reviews, buy reviews, or post one in a customer's name.</li>
          <li><strong>Shared phone numbers.</strong> A number that also answers for other shops, or a number that does not match the truck, the site, and the profile, makes the shop harder to verify. We do not set that up.</li>
          <li><strong>Rankings promises.</strong> A promise of a position is not a plan. We do not promise rankings, call volume, or revenue. We do not promise a map-pack position. No rankings promise is part of the offer.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Arkansas Automated does not sell ads management or business
